# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# Workaround for a crash of the release build on startup (R8 issue, debug build is not affected).
# Kotlin multifile facade parts (e.g. kotlin.collections.CollectionsKt__IteratorsJVMKt) are
# package-private and extend each other. R8 repackaged a part into another package, causing
# "IllegalAccessError: Class kotlin.collections.d extended by class wf is inaccessible" at startup.
# Keeping their names also keeps them in their package.
-keep,allowshrinking,allowoptimization class kotlin.**.*Kt__*

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}